e built, what data they use, and how they are tested.  \n- **Explain Decisions:** Provide simple, non‑technical summaries of AI outputs when they affect users.  \n- **Set Review Cycles:** Schedule regular checks for privacy compliance, bias, and performance.  \n- **Define Ownership:** Assign a point person for each AI project who is responsible for ethical compliance.\n\n### Why This Is Important\nFollowing ethical guidelines protects our customers, maintains our reputation, and ensures we comply with laws and industry standards. It also helps us create AI that is trustworthy and useful.\n\nIf you have any questions or need help applying these principles, please reach out to the Ethics Committee.\n\nThanks for your attention,\n\n[Your Name]  \n[Your Position]  ","reasoning":"We need rewrite email text \"AI and Ethics\" but that's just a title? Probably need expand? Actually user gave just \"Email text: AI and Ethics\". Need simplify? There's nothing. Might be missing content. Probably just output simplified version of that phrase? Could just produce short email about AI and Ethics simplified. But instruction: simplify complex language... There's no complex language. Maybe assume email content missing? I'll respond with a simple clarified email about AI and Ethics around 300 words."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"queue_time":0.395945928,"prompt_tokens":224,"prompt_time":0.008926689,"completion_tokens":612,"completion_time":1.277373165,"total_tokens":836,"total_time":1.2862998540000001,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":98}},"usage_breakdown":null,"system_fingerprint":"fp_9241e9962b","x_groq":{"id":"req_01m39a8gecebys15h0q8jg9btc","seed":559485067},"service_tier":"on_demand"}

